{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29863","headline":"大卤平後移家到永乐县居书怀十韵寄刘韦二前辈二公尝於此县寄居 · 李商隐","name":"大卤平後移家到永乐县居书怀十韵寄刘韦二前辈二公尝於此县寄居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马遶河干，家山照露寒。\n依然五柳在，况值百花残。\n昔去惊投笔，今来分挂冠。\n不忧悬磬乏，乍喜覆盂安。\n甑破宁回顾，舟沈岂暇看。\n脱身离虎口，移疾就猪肝。\n鬓入新年白，颜无旧日丹。\n自悲秋获少，谁惧夏畦难。\n逸志忘鸿鹄，清香披蕙兰。\n还持一杯酒，坐想二公懽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}